---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Free Surgeon Profile + SEO Backlinks | Increase Your Digital Presence";
const description = "Get free verified surgeon profile, interview feature, and quality backlinks. Increase your digital presence and generate more inbound patient leads. Join 70+ bariatric surgeons in Australia.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 to-blue-800 text-white py-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold mb-6">
          Increase Your Digital Presence. Generate Inbound Leads. Free.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl mb-8 text-blue-100 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Get verified profile + interview feature + SEO backlinks. Join 70+ bariatric surgeons building their online presence through Australia's only verified directory.
        </p>

        <!-- Trust Indicators -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-8 mb-10 text-blue-100">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
              <path d="M9 6a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zM17 6a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zM12.93 17c.046-.327.07-.66.07-1a6.97 6.97 0 00-1.5-4.33A5 5 0 0119 16v1h-6.07zM6 11a5 5 0 015 5v1H1v-1a5 5 0 015-5z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>70+ Surgeon Listings</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.05 4.05a7 7 0 119.9 9.9L10 18.9l-4.95-4.95a7 7 0 010-9.9zM10 11a2 2 0 100-4 2 2 0 000 4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Sydney, Melbourne & More</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M6.267 3.455a3.066 3.066 0 001.745-.723 3.066 3.066 0 013.976 0 3.066 3.066 0 001.745.723 3.066 3.066 0 012.812 2.812c.051.643.304 1.254.723 1.745a3.066 3.066 0 010 3.976 3.066 3.066 0 00-.723 1.745 3.066 3.066 0 01-2.812 2.812 3.066 3.066 0 00-1.745.723 3.066 3.066 0 01-3.976 0 3.066 3.066 0 00-1.745-.723 3.066 3.066 0 01-2.812-2.812 3.066 3.066 0 00-.723-1.745 3.066 3.066 0 010-3.976 3.066 3.066 0 00.723-1.745 3.066 3.066 0 012.812-2.812zm7.44 5.252a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Verified Surgeons</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CTA Buttons -->
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center mb-4">
          <a href="/signup" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 text-lg font-semibold text-blue-700 bg-white rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-50 transition-colors shadow-lg">
            🚀 Claim Your Free Profile
          </a>
          <a href="#what-you-get" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 text-lg font-semibold text-white bg-blue-700 rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-600 transition-colors border-2 border-white">
            See What's Included
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Lower Friction Options -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 text-sm">
          <a href="/surgeons/kogarah/dr-john-jorgensen-kogarah" target="_blank" class="text-blue-100 hover:text-white underline">
            See Example Profile →
          </a>
          <span class="text-blue-300">|</span>
          <a href="#interview" class="text-blue-100 hover:text-white underline">
            Interview Feature →
          </a>
          <span class="text-blue-300">|</span>
          <a href="#faq" class="text-blue-100 hover:text-white underline">
            Common Questions →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Reason Why Section -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white border-t-4 border-blue-600">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
          Why We Built This
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-8 rounded-lg mb-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">The Problem We Saw</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-0">
            Patients were making $15,000+ surgery decisions based on incomplete, outdated information scattered across multiple websites. Surgeons with exceptional credentials weren't being chosen simply because their information was harder to find than their competitors'.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-8 rounded-lg mb-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">The Solution</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-0">
            One comprehensive, verified directory. Updated quarterly. Exclusively for bariatric surgery in Australia. 100% free for all surgeons. Build your digital presence and generate inbound patient leads.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Problem/Solution Section -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
          Compete on Credentials, Not Marketing Budget
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Your expertise deserves to be visible. Let patients find you when they're actively choosing their surgeon.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <!-- The Problem -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-md border-l-4 border-red-500">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">The Problem</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-4">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-red-500 text-xl flex-shrink-0">❌</span>
              <span class="text-gray-700">Patients choose larger practices simply because they appear first online</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-red-500 text-xl flex-shrink-0">❌</span>
              <span class="text-gray-700">No centralized directory for bariatric surgeons exists in Australia</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-red-500 text-xl flex-shrink-0">❌</span>
              <span class="text-gray-700">Your expertise is invisible to patients actively searching</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-red-500 text-xl flex-shrink-0">❌</span>
              <span class="text-gray-700">You rely on word-of-mouth instead of systematic patient acquisition</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Our Solution -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-md border-l-4 border-green-500">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Our Solution</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-4">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-green-500 text-xl flex-shrink-0">✅</span>
              <span class="text-gray-700">Australia's ONLY comprehensive bariatric surgery directory</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-green-500 text-xl flex-shrink-0">✅</span>
              <span class="text-gray-700">Patients find you when searching "bariatric surgeon near me"</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-green-500 text-xl flex-shrink-0">✅</span>
              <span class="text-gray-700">Pre-qualified patients who are serious about weight loss surgery</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-green-500 text-xl flex-shrink-0">✅</span>
              <span class="text-gray-700">Free interview feature increases your credibility and patient trust</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Voice of Customer Section -->
  <section class="py-12 bg-blue-50 border-y-2 border-blue-200">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-md">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-4">
          <div class="text-4xl">💭</div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 italic">
              "I thought having a website was enough. But patients weren't finding me - they were finding the surgeons who appeared in multiple places online. This directory gets me in front of patients I would have never reached otherwise. It's not about replacing my website, it's about being found before patients even know which surgeon to Google."
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Stats Section -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
          Real Surgeons, Real Results
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          There are <strong>real patients actively searching</strong> for bariatric surgeons. Your practice could be capturing this visibility right now.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="text-center p-8 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg">
          <div class="text-5xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-2">70+</div>
          <div class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Surgeon Listings</div>
          <div class="text-gray-600">Across Australia</div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-8 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg">
          <div class="text-5xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-2">5x</div>
          <div class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">More Visibility</div>
          <div class="text-gray-600">With featured placement</div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-8 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg">
          <div class="text-5xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-2">24/7</div>
          <div class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Always Visible</div>
          <div class="text-gray-600">Your profile works around the clock</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Benefits Section -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
