            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-green-600 text-xl">✓</span>
              <span class="text-gray-700"><strong>800+ words unique content</strong> - Ranks for long-tail SEO</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
